  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Read spec FR-06 / FR-08 / Q2 / NFR-04 + `notes/r2-resource-investigation.md` §1/§5 + `../messaging-communication-app-r1/notes/messaging-schema-spec.md` to fix exactly what 002/003 intend to add and what MUST NOT change.</step>
    <step order="2">MCP-verify (`describe`) the live `sprk_communicationthread` entity: enumerate attributes; confirm `sprk_regardingrecordtype` is **Text**; confirm ABSENCE of typed `sprk_regarding{...}` lookups, a Lookup discriminator, a naming-edited marker, a default-thread marker, and (Q2) category/tags/description.</step>
    <step order="3">MCP-verify (`describe`) the live `sprk_communication` entity: confirm `sprk_communicationtype`, `sprk_sentby`, `sprk_sentat`, `sprk_regardingperson`, `sprk_from`/`sprk_to`/`sprk_cc` (TEXT), `sprk_cc`/`sprk_bcc` exist; confirm NO `sprk_communicationparticipant` junction exists yet.</step>
    <step order="4">Grep-verify the five `Services/Communication/**` reference files are present on this worktree (`CommunicationThreadReadService.cs`, `ThreadResolver.cs`, `Engine/Rungs/ParticipantCorrelationRung.cs`, `Engine/RegardingFieldMap.cs`, `Models/ParticipantReference.cs`); record `RegardingFieldMap.All` (the 11 entity → regarding-field pairs) verbatim.</step>
    <step order="5">MCP-`describe` an existing Spaarke option set (e.g. `sprk_communicationtype`) to read the integer convention; PROPOSE the exact `sprk_role` {From, To, Cc, Bcc} integer values task 003 will assign (deterministic, convention-aligned).</step>
    <step order="6">Write the findings note `projects/messaging-communication-app-r2/notes/001-phase0-schema-audit.md`: (a) thread live-attributes + the confirmed 002 delta + Q2 absence; (b) communication live-attributes + confirmed 003 net-new; (c) the five-file presence check + verbatim `RegardingFieldMap.All`; (d) the `sprk_role` integer plan. Explicitly list "columns that already exist — do NOT recreate" and "MUST-NOT-retype: `sprk_regardingrecordtype` (Text)".</step>
    <step order="7">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md` (001 ✅) + `current-task.md`; confirm 002 + 003 unblocked and point them at the note.</step>
  </steps>

